<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Magna Intl target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Magna Intl target raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said Wednesday it raised its target price and 1998 earnings estimate on Magna International Inc.</p>
<p>-- Raised fiscal 1998 estimate to US$4.90 per share from $4.80. Set fiscal 1999 estimate at US$6.05 per share.</p>
<p>-- Raised 12-month target price on NYSE-listed shares to $83.</p>
<p>-- Reiterated strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 65.</p>
</text>
